fail[4]: `is_valid` must be `True` only when **all three** rules pass, so join them with `and`: `long_enough and no_spaces and ends_with_digit`. With `or`, passing one rule would be enough.
error[NameError]: Check the spelling of the four names: `long_enough`, `no_spaces`, `ends_with_digit` and `is_valid`. Each one must be created with `=` before it's used.
require[and]: Use `and` to combine the three rules into `is_valid`.
